  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: Compendium_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98a8d947820b5a3448a76aaf025ea69e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 2105433060097654785
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17316704231424
    m_Localized: Statistics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231425
    m_Localized: 'Both Mystlings and Enemies are considered Creatures.

      <b>Health:</b>
      When a Creature runs out of Health it will Faint and will be removed from Battle.
      Both Mystlings and Enemies use Health.

      <b>Power:</b> How much damage
      will a Mystling deal when attacking. This stat scales with other effects, like
      Cards or status effects. Only Mystlings use Power.

      <b>Activation:</b>
      Every Mystling has a unique ability that triggers during the Creatures'' Phase
      as long as this Mystling is not standing in the front position.

      <b>Talent:</b>
      Every Mystling has a unique passive ability that may trigger in different circumstances,
      such as taking damage or defeating an Enemy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231426
    m_Localized: Cards and Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231430
    m_Localized: Player's Phase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231432
    m_Localized: Moving Mystlings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231434
    m_Localized: Creatures' Phase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231436
    m_Localized: Blessings activation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231438
    m_Localized: Consumables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231440
    m_Localized: Tamer's Ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475884666880
    m_Localized: Combat Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231427
    m_Localized: 'Use Cards to command your Mystlings and defeat Enemies. Drag a
      card onto a Mystling or an Enemy in order to activate its effect.


      Playing
      Cards requires Energy. You start each Round with 3 Energy. When you don''t
      have enough Energy to play any card in your hand, it''s time to End your Round.


      At
      the start of each Round your Energy pool will be replenished and new Cards
      will be drawn from the Draw Pile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055488
    m_Localized: Round Phase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055489
    m_Localized: Every Round consists of the Player's Phase and the Creatures' Phase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231431
    m_Localized: During this Phase you can play Cards, reposition your Mystlings
      and use Consumables. When your press the End Round button, you will end the
      Player's Phase and start the Creatures' Phase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231433
    m_Localized: 'You can freely rearrange your Mystlings during Battle by dragging
      them onto desired position. Remember that positioning defines which Mystling
      will use their Activation abilities and which one will attack.


      You
      can also rearrange your Mystlings on the World Map by pressing arrows near
      their portraits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231435
    m_Localized: 'After you End your Round all Creatures will act on their own. Enemies
      will always act before Mystlings.


      Enemies display their Intentions
      above their heads. You can hover over them with your mouse to see more details
      about the upcoming action. This action''s target will by highlighted with an
      outline.


      All Enemies will follow through with their Intentions one
      by one from last (RIGHT) to front (LEFT) position.


      Your Mystlings will
      act right after that, one by one from last (LEFT) to front (RIGHT) position.
      The Mystling standing in the front position will Attack while the rest will
      use their Activation abilities.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231437
    m_Localized: 'Blessings and Talents have particular conditions to trigger their
      effects. They may interrupt the natural flow of the Round.

      Read the
      tooltip of every Blessing carefully to maximize the effectiveness of your build!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231439
    m_Localized: Consumables are single-use items that can trigger various effects.
      You can use them only during Battle by dragging them onto desired targets (or
      simply clicking on them in some cases when they don't require a target).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 17316704231441
    m_Localized: Every Tamer has a special ability, some working during Battle, some
      outside of it. When a Tamer has an ability present during Battle, your Mystlings
      will receive a special status effect represented by an icon with a green background.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055490
    m_Localized: Progression
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055491
    m_Localized: Currencies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055492
    m_Localized: 'Treasure Chests and Battles will reward you with two basic currencies:

      <b>Gold:</b>
      Can be spent in the Shop on the Map to buy new Cards or Consumables, as well
      as in the Mystling Care Center to heal, revive or train your Mystlings.

      <b>Mystberries:</b>
      Can be spent only after Battle to purchase new Cards and Blessings for your
      Mystlings. They can also be used to revive fainted Mystlings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055493
    m_Localized: Blessings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055494
    m_Localized: 'Blessings are special passive abilities that can be purchased for
      a Mystling with Mystberries. Every Blessing has a unique effect and a trigger.


      The
      price of a Blessing will increase by 2 for every Blessing already owned by
      a Mystling.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055495
    m_Localized: Evolution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055496
    m_Localized: 'When a Mystling acquires 4 Blessings, it will evolve into a more
      powerful form.


      Evolved Mystling will have its Card upgraded. You will
      be also able to choose 1 of 3 Talents. Some of those might overwrite the original
      Talent.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055497
    m_Localized: Leveling Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055498
    m_Localized: "After each Run \u2013 successful or not \u2013 you will gain Experience
      Points. Upon gathering enough you will level up and unlock new Mystlings, Tamers
      Cards and Blessings.\n\nUnlocked Mystlings and Tamers can be chosen before
      starting a new Run. New Cards and Blessings will appear in Shops during Runs."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055499
    m_Localized: Eclipse Timer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055500
    m_Localized: Runs are time limited. The number of Battles you can undertake before
      the Eclipse arrives is defined by the Difficulty level. When the Timer reaches
      zero, the final Boss Battle will begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055501
    m_Localized: Village
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055502
    m_Localized: Free Roam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055503
    m_Localized: 'The Village is your home and base of operations. After finishing
      a Run you will always return to the Village.


      You can interact with
      Mystlings and villagers to learn more about them. Keep an eye on your pupils,
      as sometimes they will need your help with a problem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055504
    m_Localized: Kitchen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055505
    m_Localized: Before you embark on your next adventure you can order one random
      Consumable in the Kitchen. Don't worry, it's on the house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055506
    m_Localized: Effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055507
    m_Localized: Status effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055508
    m_Localized: <b>Shields:</b> Defends Health from incoming damage until the next
      Round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055509
    m_Localized: <b>Wrath:</b> Increases Power until the end of Battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055510
    m_Localized: <b>Strength:</b> Increases Power until the end of Round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055511
    m_Localized: <b>Insulate:</b> Reduce next incoming damage to 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055512
    m_Localized: <b>Dodge:</b> Prevents Creature from being damaged. Status counter
      decreases by 1 after each attack dodged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055513
    m_Localized: <b>Multistrike:</b> Increase the amount of attacks for each Multistrike
      counter for 1 turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055514
    m_Localized: <b>Permanent Multistrike:</b> Increase the amount of attacks for
      each Multistrike counter until the end of the Battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055515
    m_Localized: <b>Revive:</b> Instantly revive this Creature with 50% of its Max
      Health after fainting. Decrease status value by 1 after each revive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055516
    m_Localized: <b>Thorns:</b> When attacked, deal damage equal to Thorns value
      to the attacker. Status disappears right after.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055517
    m_Localized: <b>Vulnerable:</b> When this Creature takes any kind of damage from
      any source, it takes additional damage equal to Vulnerable value. Decrease
      status value after each hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055518
    m_Localized: <b>Weakness:</b> Decreases Power for each Weakness counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055519
    m_Localized: '<b>Lifesteal:</b> Attack: Heal self equal to damage dealt to an
      enemy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055520
    m_Localized: <b>Guarded:</b> Reduce damage received by 50%. Decrease each Round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055521
    m_Localized: <b>Exposed:</b> Increase damage received by 100%. Decrease each
      Round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055522
    m_Localized: <b>Stun:</b> Creature can't activate or attack. Decreases by 1 at
      the start of Round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055523
    m_Localized: Triggers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055528
    m_Localized: Keywords
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 67405132931072
    m_Localized: '<b>Exhaust:</b> Remove from the deck until the end of Battle after
      playing.

      <b>Overload:</b> Play this card as many times as the number
      of cards played this Round.

      <b>Grow:</b> Every time this card is played,
      increase its value by Grow count until the end of Battle.

      <b>Wither:</b>
      Every time this card is played, decrease its value by Wither count until the
      end of Battle.

      <b>Enchant Position:</b> Apply an Enchantment to a Position.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055534
    m_Localized: Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055535
    m_Localized: Blessings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055536
    m_Localized: Consumables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055537
    m_Localized: <b>Raw Steak:</b> Apply Strength to selected Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055538
    m_Localized: <b>Raspberry Cheesecake:</b> Apply Shields to selected Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055539
    m_Localized: <b>Nutritious Soup:</b> Heal selected Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055540
    m_Localized: <b>Fancy Dessert:</b> Apply Revive to selected Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055541
    m_Localized: <b>Well-balanced dish:</b> Gain 2 Random Consumables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055542
    m_Localized: <b>Hot Brew:</b> Permanently increase selected Mystling's Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055543
    m_Localized: <b>Fruit Salad:</b> Permanently increase selected Mystling's Max
      Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055544
    m_Localized: <b>Fresh Greens:</b> Apply Dodge to selected Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055545
    m_Localized: <b>Bowl of Garlic:</b> Draw Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 54475893055546
    m_Localized: <b>Strong Tea:</b> Gain 2 Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 67300346634240
    m_Localized: '<b>Hurt:</b> When the Creature loses Health.

      <b>Attacked:</b>
      When the Creature receives any kind of damage, even when it doesn''t lose any
      Health.

      <b>Knock Out:</b> When the Creature defeats other creature.

      <b>Faint:</b>
      When the Creature''s Health is reduced to zero.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654785
  - m_Id: 264007820933885952
    m_Localized: Mystling Eggs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264007820933885953
    m_Localized: 'To gain a new Mystling, you need to hatch its Egg first. Every
      new unlocked Egg will show up in the Hatchery building in your village.

      To
      hatch it you will have to complete a challenge. You can check your progress
      in the Hatchery building in between runs.

      Once your challenge is completed
      your Egg will hatch a new Mystlign will be available for a new run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
